WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
Around the rim of the Wheel of
Life run twelve small pictures.

2
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.560
A blind person with a stick.

3
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.290
A potter at work.

4
00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.180
A monkey swinging from branch to branch.

5
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:15.490
Together they form a chain: each
link a condition for the next,

6
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.510
from ignorance to ageing and death.

7
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.800
Buddhists believe this chain keeps
suffering and rebirth turning.

8
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.990
So if suffering comes
from a chain of causes,

9
00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.540
which link can you actually break?

10
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.630
In this mission, you'll follow
all twelve links in order,

11
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.550
and decode their pictures.

12
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.070
Then you'll compare two
readings: across three lives,

13
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.540
or in one passing moment.

14
00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.750
Your mission: find out which link in the
chain can actually be broken, and how.
